2. Jagged Alliance 2 v1.13 INI Editor schemas
   (ja2-launcher/shell/embedded_schemas/)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIEditorJA2.xml, INIEditorJA2Options.xml, and INIEditorAPBPConstants.xml
are reproduced from the configuration-editor schema data distributed with
the Jagged Alliance 2 v1.13 mod, authored by the JA2 1.13 community. The
remaining INIEditor*.xml files are generated from the descriptive comments
inside JA2 1.13 INI files. That descriptive text originates with the JA2
1.13 community and is the property of its original authors; it is included
so the launcher can present human-readable setting descriptions.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Derived map-statistics corpus
   (sidecar/mercwizard_core/mapforge/corpus/*.json)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
These files contain aggregate statistics (tile-index frequencies and
per-biome layer coverage) computed from Jagged Alliance 2 v1.13 community
map files. They contain no game art or executable content — only derived
numeric metadata — and drive Merc Forge's map generators.
